tes from Earth are enrolled there, which will lead to an awkward reunion if he is to meet them.\n\nBehind the scenes, however, an enigmatic cult called The Great Devil Order devises a sinister scheme to resurrect their deity and sacrifice the students of Barbador to hasten the process. As Seiichi's power is second to none, it is up to him to protect not only his friends but also the entire world from the looming darkness.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Monster Girl","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Teacher","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slavery","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Polyamorous","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Fruit of Evolution: Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made Season 2","english":"The Fruit of Evolution: Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made Season 2","native":"真・進化の実～知らないうちに勝ち組人生～","romaji":"Shin Shinka no Mi: Shiranai Uchi ni Kachigumi Jinsei","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"真・进化果实～不知不觉踏上胜利的人生～"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"进化果实～不知不觉踏上胜利的人生～ 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"進化の実～知らないうちに勝ち組人生～ 第2期"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"真・进化之实 踏上胜利的人生"}]},"trailer":{"id":"d5FndkCYsXE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/d5FndkCYsXE/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}